      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It sounds like these pockets of gas can be really deceptive. Are there any other subtle or 'sneaky' ways these risks manifest in a warehouse setting that wouldn't be immediately obvious to a regular inspector walking through? Like, things that happen 'behind the scenes' in the facility structure?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
